==Strategy==
The main difficulty of this stage comes from the peons knocking cats into Cruel Angel Clionel's range, therefore a typical strategy would involve using fast units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to deal as much damage to her as possible before more peons can spawn. A level 30+ [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] (ideally with [[True Form]] and [[Talents]]) is recommended to have, as well as [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]] units. [[Ushiwakamaru (Legend Rare Cat)|Ushiwakamaru]] can even solo this stage if spammed with the help of Research [[Cat Combo|Combos]].

[[A Gift of Cats (Rare Cat)|Cat's Gift]] can be helpful, as it can intercept Clionel's blind spot and freeze Clionel, allowing for better timing of your other units. Despite this, its freeze has only a 30% activation chance, and thus is unreliable. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] can be helpful against the Angelic Gories in this stage, provided you lure.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]]: Rips Angels to shreds and can fit inside Cruel Angel Clionel's blind spot. Beware that Sleipnir will either knock her back into Clionel's effective range or stunlock her to death.
*[[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|Guardian Gamereon]] or [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder God Zeus]]: Both can tank an ungodly amount of punishment and can help clear out the Angelic Gories and Trolly Bloggers. They can help give you breathing room and even dish out some damage on their own, but be careful of knockback from the Sleipnir and Bloggers.
*[[Juvens (Uber Rare Cat)|Juvens]]: Juvens works similarly to Guardian Gamereon. Juvens has less health but faster cooldown and the dodge vs Angels ability. He can deal out 10k DPS with a fast recharge time, while tanking and randomly dodging the attacks of Angelic Gory and Sleipnir's. Juvens has less range though, and acts more as an uber variant of [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]].
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: Fast, spammable, and can lay the pain on Angels. He can easily control the Angelic Gories back and shoot down Clionel once they get in. With good meatshielding, he can also stay far behind enough to not be affected by Sleipnir's attacks.
*[[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Lord Gao]]: While he will stand right in Clionel's effective range, Gao is resistant enough to tank at least one Clionel shot before getting knocked back and can retaliate with at least one shot of his own. He also outranges Sleipnir and can clear out the Angelic Gories.
*[[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Merchant Babil]]: Dark Merchant Babil can completely wipe out hordes of Angels and apply the smackdown on Clionel with ease. While he is rather fragile (only being able to take 4 shots before dying), his damage output is nothing to scoff at, and the increased money gain can help if you're running low on cash.
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Takeda Shingen (Uber Rare Cat)|Takeda Shingen]]: Shingen with the Angel target talent is able to do massive nuke damage to the Angelic Gories and/or Sleipnir, but doesn't work to well against Clionel itself due to his slow movement speed even with his massive health, so it is recommended to lure what you want him to attack first when using him here.
*[[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]]: Yukimura can act as a second Awakened Bahamut and assist with rushing down Sleipnir and Clionel.
*[[Netherworld Nymph Lunacia (Uber Rare Cat)|Netherworld Nymph Lunacia]]: Wreaks havoc against everything here with her abilities and tankiness, allowing you to focus your lineup more towards the continuation stage.

